Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 12:30:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] browse: keep loading animation visible-only and model real
 cached restoration

Avoid an offscreen infinite loading spinner. Exercise a fresh replayed Paging presenter after complete disposal and distinguish successful Activity pause/return from a rejected external launch. Shared with mihon-harmony 0100.
---
